zuutf bundles simdutf, https://github.com/simdutf/simdutf, in
src/vendor/simdutf/: the files simdutf.h, simdutf.cpp and simdutf_c.h from
the single-header release artefact (singleheader.zip) of release v9.2.1,
unmodified, and LICENSE-MIT from the tagged commit.

simdutf is dual-licensed under the Apache License 2.0 and the MIT licence,
at the user's choice. zuutf elects the MIT licence, whose text is in
src/vendor/simdutf/LICENSE-MIT and below.

tools/vendor/manifest.tsv records the tag, the commit
(dc3f7a8fa291f2ce793c7b0ddd458f4e67542f14) and the SHA-256 of the archive,
and tools/vendor/checksums.sha256 the SHA-256 of every bundled file, in the
package's source repository, https://github.com/pedrobtz/zuutf.

